sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    participant SC as Scheduler
    participant ST as Settlement Service
    participant LD as Vendor Ledger
    actor FIN as Finance / Admin
    participant PA as Paymob Adapter
    participant PM as Paymob Send
    participant OS as Object Storage
    participant VP as Vendor Portal
    actor VD as Vendor

    Note over SC,VD: Requirement 8.4, 8.6, 12.1 - automated vendor settlement.<br/>Calculation is Phase 1. Automated Paymob Send disbursement is Phase 2.

    SC->>ST: run settlement cycle (per vendor schedule)
    ST->>LD: read unsettled entries for vendor

    LD-->>ST: SALE credits (delivered items only)
    LD-->>ST: COMMISSION debits
    LD-->>ST: SHIPPING cost allocations
    LD-->>ST: PENALTY debits
    LD-->>ST: RETURN_REVERSAL debits
    LD-->>ST: EXCHANGE adjustments
    LD-->>ST: manual ADJUSTMENT / BONUS entries

    ST->>ST: net payable = sum(signed amounts)
    Note right of ST: Every line traces to an order_item.<br/>No aggregate is computed from a<br/>spreadsheet formula - the ledger<br/>is the single source of truth.

    alt net payable <= 0
        ST->>LD: carry negative balance to next cycle
        Note right of LD: A vendor whose returns exceed<br/>sales this cycle owes the platform.<br/>Requirement 8.7.
    end

    ST->>ST: INSERT SETTLEMENTS + SETTLEMENT_LINES
    ST->>VP: publish draft statement (vendor can preview)

    FIN->>ST: review and approve
    Note right of FIN: Human approval gate stays even<br/>in Phase 2. Money never moves<br/>on an automated decision alone.

    alt Phase 1 - manual disbursement
        FIN->>FIN: transfer via bank / wallet
        FIN->>ST: upload transfer proof
    else Phase 2 - Paymob Send
        ST->>PA: disburse(vendor bank / wallet, amount)
        PA->>PM: POST instant cashin / bulk disbursement
        PM-->>PA: transaction reference
        PM->>PA: HMAC-signed disbursement callback
        alt disbursement succeeded
            PA->>ST: mark settlement paid
        else disbursement failed
            PA->>ST: mark failed, alert finance, do NOT retry blindly
            Note right of PA: Retrying a payout without an<br/>idempotency key is how vendors<br/>get paid twice. Never auto-retry.
        end
    end

    ST->>OS: store transfer proof document
    ST->>LD: mark entries settled (link to settlement_line)

    par notify
        ST->>VD: email - payout processed
    and publish
        ST->>VP: statement + transfer proof visible
    end

    VD->>VP: view next payout date, pending balance,<br/>previous payouts, proof PDF
    Note over VD,VP: Requirement 8.4 + 8.6 -<br/>replaces the current manual<br/>vendor payout enquiries.
